  "title": "Template parameter lists",
  "summary": "Multiline template parameter lists fold on their angle brackets",
  "prose": "Class, function, variable and alias templates, partial specializations,\nthe lists an out-of-line member definition repeats, template template\nparameters and lambdas with explicit template parameters all fold their\nparameter lists.",
